{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-test-oracle","title":"AI 作为测试预言机：断言生成、行为推断与不变式发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-testing/foundations/ai-test-oracle","wordCount":1913,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-作为测试预言机-断言生成-行为推断与不变式发现\">AI 作为测试预言机：断言生成、行为推断与不变式发现</h1><p>&quot;测试预言机&quot;（Test Oracle）是软件测试领域一个有技术含义的概念：给定一个程序输入，Oracle 就是那个能判断输出是否正确的裁判。传统上，Oracle 就是你手写的断言——<code>expect(result).toBe(42)</code> 就是最简单的 Oracle，它把正确答案硬编码进来。把 LLM 作为 Oracle 使用，是 AI 测试工程里最有潜力、也最容易被滥用的技术方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>测试预言机</strong>（Test Oracle）：判断给定程序输入下，输出是否正确的裁判；断言就是最简单的 Oracle 实现。</p>\n<p><strong>Oracle 问题</strong>（Oracle Problem）：对复杂系统，&quot;什么是正确输出&quot;本身难以精确定义；非确定性输出（如 LLM 摘要）无法用精确相等断言。</p>\n<p><strong>不变式</strong>（Invariant）：程序在任意合法输入下都应满足的全局性质，例如&quot;排序后元素个数不变&quot;；LLM 能从函数语义自动推断候选不变式。</p>\n<p><strong>差分 Oracle</strong>（Differential Oracle）：用两个不同实现互相验证——结果必须一致，不需要知道&quot;正确答案&quot;是什么。</p>\n<p><strong>变质关系</strong>（Metamorphic Relation）：描述输入变换如何对应输出变换的性质，例如&quot;价格翻倍，折扣后金额也翻倍&quot;；是属性测试的核心工具。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Oracle 形态</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>断言生成</td>\n<td>函数签名 + 规格</td>\n<td>中（需独立验证期望值）</td>\n<td>纯函数、明确语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为推断</td>\n<td>函数语义 + 命名</td>\n<td>中高（性质比值可靠）</td>\n<td>有隐式约束的函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不变式发现</td>\n<td>领域知识 + 类型</td>\n<td>高（可做属性测试）</td>\n<td>数据结构、编解码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差分 Oracle</td>\n<td>两个实现</td>\n<td>最高（不依赖正确答案）</td>\n<td>重构/迁移验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"oracle-问题-为什么-判断正确性-很难\">Oracle 问题：为什么&quot;判断正确性&quot;很难</h2><p>软件测试里有个经典的&quot;Oracle 问题&quot;：对于一个给定的输入，你怎么知道程序的输出是正确的？</p>\n<p>对于简单情况，这个问题不存在——<code>add(2, 3)</code> 必须等于 5，你直接写死。但随着系统复杂度上升，Oracle 问题就越来越难回答：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>非确定性输出</strong>：<code>summarize(article)</code> 的&quot;正确&quot;结果是什么？同一篇文章可以有无数个合理的摘要。</li>\n<li><strong>规格不完整</strong>：文档只写了&quot;应该返回用户列表&quot;，没写顺序、没写处理空情况时的行为。</li>\n<li><strong>隐式性质</strong>：一个排序函数不仅应该&quot;输出有序&quot;，还应该&quot;保留原始元素&quot;、&quot;对重复元素的相对顺序有明确定义&quot;——这些性质通常不在文档里。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这就是 LLM Oracle 的价值所在：它能从语义层面推断那些隐式性质，产生人工难以穷举的测试约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"oracle-的三种形态\">Oracle 的三种形态</h2><h3 id=\"形态一-断言生成-assertion-generation\">形态一：断言生成（Assertion Generation）</h3><p><strong>是什么</strong>：给定函数签名和一个具体的输入，LLM 推断期望的输出并生成断言。</p>\n<p><strong>适用范围</strong>：有明确语义的纯函数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 给 LLM 的输入&#10;function parseDate(dateStr: string): Date | null {&#10;  // 实现...&#10;}&#10;&#10;// LLM 可以生成的断言（specification-driven）&#10;expect(parseDate(&#39;2026-07-04&#39;)).toEqual(new Date(2026, 6, 4));&#10;expect(parseDate(&#39;invalid&#39;)).toBeNull();&#10;expect(parseDate(&#39;2026-02-29&#39;)).toBeNull(); // 2026 不是闰年&#10;expect(parseDate(&#39;&#39;)).toBeNull();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 给 LLM 的输入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dateStr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 实现...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LLM 可以生成的断言（specification-driven）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-07-04'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2026</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'invalid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-02-29'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2026 不是闰年</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parseDate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeNull</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>断言生成的可靠性取决于函数语义的清晰程度。函数越纯、规格越明确，生成的断言越可信。带有副作用、依赖外部状态的函数，断言生成的可信度会显著下降。</p>\n<p><strong>关键陷阱——值幻觉（Value Hallucination）</strong>：</p>\n<p>模型可能自信地生成一个具体的期望值，但这个值是错的。例如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 危险：模型可能生成基于其数学推断的期望值，但算法有特殊边界&#10;expect(fibonacci(50)).toBe(12586269025); // 这个数对吗？需要验证\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 危险：模型可能生成基于其数学推断的期望值，但算法有特殊边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fibonacci</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12586269025</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 这个数对吗？需要验证</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于涉及具体数值计算的断言，不要直接信任 LLM 给出的期望值——必须独立计算或运行程序获取真实值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"形态二-行为推断-behavioral-inference\">形态二：行为推断（Behavioral Inference）</h3><p><strong>是什么</strong>：LLM 不是断言具体的返回值，而是断言函数应该满足的<strong>行为性质</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>适用范围</strong>：规格不完整、但函数有可以从命名和文档推断的语义约束。</p>\n<p>行为推断产生的不是 <code>expect(result).toBe(42)</code> 这样的值断言，而是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 行为推断：从函数语义推断的性质&#10;describe(&#39;sortUsers&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;should preserve all input elements&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const input = [u3, u1, u2];&#10;    const output = sortUsers(input);&#10;    expect(output).toHaveLength(input.length);&#10;    expect(output.map((u) =&gt; u.id).sort()).toEqual(input.map((u) =&gt; u.id).sort());&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;should produce a stable sort for equal-priority users&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    const input = [&#10;      { id: 1, priority: 5, name: &#39;Alice&#39; },&#10;      { id: 2, priority: 5, name: &#39;Bob&#39; },&#10;    ];&#10;    const output = sortUsers(input);&#10;    // 相同优先级的用户相对顺序应该保持不变&#10;    const aliceIndex = output.findIndex((u) =&gt; u.id === 1);&#10;    const bobIndex = output.findIndex((u) =&gt; u.id === 2);&#10;    expect(aliceIndex).toBeLessThan(bobIndex);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 行为推断：从函数语义推断的性质</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sortUsers'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should preserve all input elements'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [u3, u1, u2];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sortUsers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(output).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toHaveLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(output.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u.id).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u.id).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'should produce a stable sort for equal-priority users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sortUsers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(input);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 相同优先级的用户相对顺序应该保持不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> aliceIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bobIndex</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> u.id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(aliceIndex).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeLessThan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bobIndex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这类行为推断的可信度通常高于具体值断言，因为&quot;排序后长度不变&quot;这类性质是从函数语义可以可靠推断的，而具体排序结果则需要知道完整实现逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"形态三-不变式发现-invariant-discovery\">形态三：不变式发现（Invariant Discovery）</h3><p><strong>是什么</strong>：LLM 推断函数或系统在任何合法输入下都应该满足的<strong>全局约束</strong>，这些约束可以作为属性测试（property-based testing）的 property。</p>\n<p><strong>适用范围</strong>：有明确数学或语义约束的领域——数据结构操作、编解码、加密/解密、状态机。</p>\n<p>不变式发现是 AI Oracle 最强大的能力，因为它能产生传统测试方法很难系统化发现的测试约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// LLM 从 Stack 的语义推断的不变式&#10;const stackInvariants = [&#10;  // 先进后出&#10;  &#39;pop() 应该返回最近一次 push() 的值&#39;,&#10;  // 大小一致性&#10;  &#39;push 之后 size() 应该比之前大 1&#39;,&#10;  // pop 之后 size 减少&#10;  &#39;pop() 之后 size() 应该比之前小 1&#39;,&#10;  // 幂等性 peek&#10;  &#39;连续两次 peek() 返回相同结果且不改变 size()&#39;,&#10;  // 空栈保护&#10;  &#39;在空栈上调用 pop() 应该抛出 EmptyStackError&#39;,&#10;];&#10;&#10;// 这些不变式可以直接转化为 property-based tests&#10;fc.assert(&#10;  fc.property(fc.array(fc.integer(), { minLength: 1 }), (items) =&gt; {&#10;    const stack = new Stack();&#10;    items.forEach((item) =&gt; stack.push(item));&#10;    // 验证：pop 的顺序是 push 顺序的逆序&#10;    const popped = items.map(() =&gt; stack.pop());&#10;    expect(popped).toEqual([...items].reverse());&#10;  }),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LLM 从 Stack 的语义推断的不变式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stackInvariants</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 先进后出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'pop() 应该返回最近一次 push() 的值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 大小一致性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'push 之后 size() 应该比之前大 1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // pop 之后 size 减少</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'pop() 之后 size() 应该比之前小 1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 幂等性 peek</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '连续两次 peek() 返回相同结果且不改变 size()'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 空栈保护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '在空栈上调用 pop() 应该抛出 EmptyStackError'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 这些不变式可以直接转化为 property-based tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), { minLength: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    items.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 验证：pop 的顺序是 push 顺序的逆序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> popped</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stack.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(popped).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">items].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ai-oracle-的可靠性评估框架\">AI Oracle 的可靠性评估框架</h2><p>并不是所有的 Oracle 推断都一样可靠。下面这个框架帮助你判断 LLM 的 Oracle 输出在多大程度上可以信任：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[LLM生成的Oracle断言] --&gt; B{是值断言还是性质断言?}&#10;    B --&gt; C[值断言]&#10;    B --&gt; D[性质断言]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; E{值是否能独立验证?}&#10;    E --&gt; F[能:可信]&#10;    E --&gt; G[不能:需要独立计算后验证]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; H{性质是否来自明确规格?}&#10;    H --&gt; I[是:可信]&#10;    H --&gt; J{性质是否可以从语义明显推断?}&#10;    J --&gt; K[是:中等可信,建议mutation testing验证]&#10;    J --&gt; L[否:低可信,需人工审查]\">flowchart TD\n    A[LLM生成的Oracle断言] --&gt; B{是值断言还是性质断言?}\n    B --&gt; C[值断言]\n    B --&gt; D[性质断言]\n\n    C --&gt; E{值是否能独立验证?}\n    E --&gt; F[能:可信]\n    E --&gt; G[不能:需要独立计算后验证]\n\n    D --&gt; H{性质是否来自明确规格?}\n    H --&gt; I[是:可信]\n    H --&gt; J{性质是否可以从语义明显推断?}\n    J --&gt; K[是:中等可信,建议mutation testing验证]\n    J --&gt; L[否:低可信,需人工审查]</pre><h2 id=\"oracle-在实践中的应用模式\">Oracle 在实践中的应用模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-差分-oracle-differential-oracle\">模式一：差分 Oracle（Differential Oracle）</h3><p>用两个不同的实现互相验证。当你在重写一个老模块时，可以让 LLM 帮你生成差分测试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// LLM 生成差分测试框架&#10;describe(&#39;refactored sort vs original sort&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  fc.assert(&#10;    fc.property(fc.array(fc.record({ id: fc.integer(), value: fc.string() })), (input) =&gt; {&#10;      const original = originalSortUsers([...input]);&#10;      const refactored = refactoredSortUsers([...input]);&#10;      // 结果应该相同&#10;      expect(refactored).toEqual(original);&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LLM 生成差分测试框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refactored sort vs original sort'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ id: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), value: fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() })), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> original</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> originalSortUsers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> refactored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> refactoredSortUsers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">input]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 结果应该相同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(refactored).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(original);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>差分 Oracle 不需要 LLM 知道&quot;正确答案是什么&quot;，只需要它知道&quot;两个实现的结果应该一致&quot;，可信度最高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-metamorphic-oracle-变质关系-oracle\">模式二：metamorphic Oracle（变质关系 Oracle）</h3><p>定义输入之间的变换关系，以及这些变换对输出的影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// LLM 推断的 metamorphic relation&#10;// &quot;把价格翻倍，折扣后的价格也应该翻倍&quot;&#10;it(&#39;metamorphic: price doubling&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  fc.assert(&#10;    fc.property(fc.float({ min: 0.01, max: 1000 }), fc.constantFrom(&#39;regular&#39;, &#39;gold&#39;, &#39;diamond&#39;), (price, level) =&gt; {&#10;      const discount1 = calculateDiscount(price, level);&#10;      const discount2 = calculateDiscount(price * 2, level);&#10;      // metamorphic relation: 价格翻倍，折扣后价格也翻倍&#10;      expect(discount2).toBeCloseTo(discount1 * 2, 5);&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LLM 推断的 metamorphic relation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// \"把价格翻倍，折扣后的价格也应该翻倍\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'metamorphic: price doubling'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">assert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">property</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ min: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, max: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }), fc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">constantFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'regular'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'diamond'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> discount1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDiscount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price, level);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> discount2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDiscount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, level);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // metamorphic relation: 价格翻倍，折扣后价格也翻倍</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(discount2).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeCloseTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(discount1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>变质 Oracle 特别适合数学性质明显的函数，LLM 能很好地发现这类关系。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式三-状态机-oracle\">模式三：状态机 Oracle</h3><p>对于有状态的系统，LLM 可以推断合法的状态转换路径，以及每个状态下的不变式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// LLM 推断购物车状态机的不变式&#10;const cartInvariants = {&#10;  EMPTY: &#39;totalItems === 0 &amp;&amp; totalPrice === 0&#39;,&#10;  HAS_ITEMS: &#39;totalItems &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; totalPrice &gt; 0&#39;,&#10;  CHECKED_OUT: &#39;不可再添加商品&#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 状态转换后的性质&#10;const transitions = {&#10;  &#39;EMPTY -&gt; addItem -&gt; HAS_ITEMS&#39;: &#39;总价应该等于加入商品的价格&#39;,&#10;  &#39;HAS_ITEMS -&gt; removeLastItem -&gt; EMPTY&#39;: &#39;总价应该归零&#39;,&#10;  &#39;HAS_ITEMS -&gt; checkout -&gt; CHECKED_OUT&#39;: &#39;orderId 应该生成&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// LLM 推断购物车状态机的不变式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cartInvariants</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  EMPTY: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'totalItems === 0 &#x26;&#x26; totalPrice === 0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  HAS_ITEMS: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'totalItems > 0 &#x26;&#x26; totalPrice > 0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  CHECKED_OUT: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不可再添加商品'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 状态转换后的性质</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transitions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'EMPTY -> addItem -> HAS_ITEMS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'总价应该等于加入商品的价格'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'HAS_ITEMS -> removeLastItem -> EMPTY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'总价应该归零'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'HAS_ITEMS -> checkout -> CHECKED_OUT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orderId 应该生成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"幻觉的系统性防范\">幻觉的系统性防范</h2><p>Oracle 幻觉的最大危险不是生成的测试会&quot;跑红&quot;（那样你会立刻发现问题），而是生成了一个&quot;永远跑绿&quot;但实际上检测不到任何 bug 的空洞测试。</p>\n<p><strong>检测幻觉的唯一可靠方法</strong>：让测试在一个已知有 bug 的代码版本上运行，看它是否会失败。这就是 mutation testing 的原理——用程序化方式制造 bug，验证测试能否发现。</p>\n<p>具体工作流：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>LLM 生成一批测试断言</li>\n<li>对被测代码运行 mutation testing（Stryker for JS/TS、Pitest for Java、mutmut for Python）</li>\n<li>找出&quot;存活的变异体&quot;——那些没有被任何测试检测到的代码改动</li>\n<li>把存活变异体信息反馈给 LLM：「这个变异体存活了，请生成能杀死它的测试」</li>\n<li>重跑 mutation testing 验证</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个闭环可以系统化地消除幻觉断言，同时利用 LLM 弥补了人工识别&quot;应该测什么&quot;的局限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Oracle 问题是软件测试的核心难题——&quot;如何判断输出是否正确&quot;在复杂系统里没有简单答案，AI Oracle 是缓解这个问题的一种有效工具。</li>\n<li>AI Oracle 有三种形态：值断言（具体期望值，可信度依赖独立验证）、行为推断（性质断言，通常比值断言更可靠）、不变式发现（全局约束，最强大也最适合属性测试）。</li>\n<li>差分 Oracle、变质 Oracle、状态机 Oracle 是三种实用的应用模式，其中差分 Oracle 可信度最高，因为它不依赖 LLM 推断正确答案。</li>\n<li>防范 Oracle 幻觉的唯一可靠方法是 mutation testing：让测试在已知有 bug 的代码版本上运行，验证测试能否检测到这些 bug。</li>\n<li>AI Oracle 能突破&quot;工程师想象力上限&quot;的边界，系统化地发现隐式性质，这是它相对传统 Oracle 的核心优势。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AI 作为测试预言机：断言生成、行为推断与不变式发现","id":"ai-作为测试预言机-断言生成-行为推断与不变式发现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Oracle 问题：为什么\"判断正确性\"很难","id":"oracle-问题-为什么-判断正确性-很难"},{"level":2,"text":"Oracle 的三种形态","id":"oracle-的三种形态"},{"level":3,"text":"形态一：断言生成（Assertion Generation）","id":"形态一-断言生成-assertion-generation"},{"level":3,"text":"形态二：行为推断（Behavioral Inference）","id":"形态二-行为推断-behavioral-inference"},{"level":3,"text":"形态三：不变式发现（Invariant Discovery）","id":"形态三-不变式发现-invariant-discovery"},{"level":2,"text":"AI Oracle 的可靠性评估框架","id":"ai-oracle-的可靠性评估框架"},{"level":2,"text":"Oracle 在实践中的应用模式","id":"oracle-在实践中的应用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：差分 Oracle（Differential Oracle）","id":"模式一-差分-oracle-differential-oracle"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：metamorphic Oracle（变质关系 Oracle）","id":"模式二-metamorphic-oracle-变质关系-oracle"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：状态机 Oracle","id":"模式三-状态机-oracle"},{"level":2,"text":"幻觉的系统性防范","id":"幻觉的系统性防范"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AI 测试生成全景：从传统自动化到 LLM 生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-testing/foundations/ai-testing-landscape"},"next":{"title":"AI 参与测试工程的全景地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-testing/foundations/testing-landscape-map"}}